<view class="apply ab-safe-bottom">
  <text class="apply__eyebrow">HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED</text>
  <text class="apply__title">公开标签申请</text>
  <text class="apply__lead">选择目录标签、创建草稿并提交必要材料。OCR 或 AI 结果只可作为辅助检查，绝不会自动批准。</text>

  <view class="apply__warning" aria-role="note">
    <text class="apply__warning-title">材料最小化原则</text>
    <text>请勿上传真实身份证原件、银行卡、家庭资产等超出业务必要范围的材料。单份不超过 5 MB，最多 3 份。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="apply__warning apply__warning--risk" aria-role="note">
    财富、资产、车辆和家庭背景类标签在 P0 不具备公开资格；普通审核通过也不代表可以公开。
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="apply__error" aria-role="alert">{{errorMessage}}</view>

  <view class="apply__section">
    <text class="apply__step">01</text>
    <text class="apply__section-title">选择标签</text>
    <text class="apply__section-note">目录接口当前只返回可用标签；分类、公开资格和独立合规开关须由冻结合同 proposal 补齐。</text>
    <view wx:if="{{labels.length}}" class="apply__labels">
      <ab-tag-application
        wx:for="{{labels}}"
        wx:key="labelId"
        label-id="{{item.labelId}}"
        name-zh="{{item.nameZh}}"
        name-en="{{item.nameEn}}"
        description-zh="{{item.descriptionZh}}"
        enabled="{{item.enabled}}"
        selected="{{selectedLabelId === item.labelId}}"
        busy="{{busyAction || verificationRequestId}}"
        bind:select="onSelectLabel"
      />
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{loadingCatalog}}" class="apply__empty" aria-role="status">正在读取标签目录…</view>
    <view wx:else class="apply__empty">当前没有可申请标签。</view>
    <button
      wx:if="{{selectedLabelId && !verificationRequestId}}"
      class="apply__button apply__button--primary"
      loading="{{busyAction === 'create-draft'}}"
      disabled="{{busyAction}}"
      bindtap="onCreateDraft"
    >创建申请草稿</button>
    <view wx:if="{{verificationRequestId}}" class="apply__draft-fact">草稿已创建 · 当前状态 {{currentStatus}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{verificationRequestId}}" class="apply__section">
    <text class="apply__step">02</text>
    <text class="apply__section-title">补充必要材料</text>
    <text class="apply__section-note">原件路径不在页面展示，公开 API 也不得返回原件 URL。</text>
    <view class="apply__chooser">
      <button class="apply__button apply__button--quiet" disabled="{{busyAction || materials.length >= 3}}" bindtap="onChooseImages">选择图片</button>
      <button class="apply__button apply__button--quiet" disabled="{{busyAction || materials.length >= 3}}" bindtap="onChooseDocuments">选择 PDF / 图片文件</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{materials.length}}" class="apply__materials">
      <view wx:for="{{materials}}" wx:key="localId" class="apply__material">
        <view class="apply__material-main">
          <text class="apply__material-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="apply__material-meta">{{item.sizeLabel}} · {{item.statusLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <button class="apply__remove" data-local-id="{{item.localId}}" disabled="{{busyAction}}" bindtap="onRemoveMaterial" aria-label="移除{{item.name}}">移除</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{existingEvidenceCount}}" class="apply__draft-fact">已有 {{existingEvidenceCount}} 份私有材料（不显示原件地址）</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{verificationRequestId}}" class="apply__section">
    <text class="apply__step">03</text>
    <text class="apply__section-title">本人声明并提交</text>
    <textarea
      class="apply__textarea"
      value="{{userStatement}}"
      maxlength="500"
      placeholder="说明申请理由与材料能证明的事实；请勿填写不必要的敏感信息。"
      bindinput="onStatementInput"
      disabled="{{busyAction}}"
      aria-label="标签申请本人声明"
    />
    <view class="apply__public-choice" aria-role="note">
      <text class="apply__warning-title">公开展示意愿</text>
      <text>当前冻结提交 DTO 尚未承载本人公开选择，因此本次提交只进入审核，不会由客户端承诺自动公开。</text>
    </view>
    <button class="apply__button apply__button--primary" loading="{{busyAction === 'submit'}}" disabled="{{busyAction}}" bindtap="onSubmit">提交人工审核</button>
  </view>
</view>
